# Grid B — U7 History / Negative Observation
#
# Regression target: a bounded no-hit result in git history is VCS negative
# observation, not a repository grep absence and not a scalar commit answer.
# The answer should state the searched history scope and the zero-result
# boundary without inventing current-source file:line citations.
ID="u7m"
NAME="history — recent commit no-hit negative observation"
ABSENT_MARKER="definitely_no_such_marker_20260521"_"negative_observation"
QUESTION="最近 20 次提交里有没有提到 ${ABSENT_MARKER}？如果没有，请说明搜索范围。"
EXPECT_NOT_CONTAINS="**值：**"
EXPECT_MATCHES_REGEX="(没有|未发现|未找到|0).*(${ABSENT_MARKER}|最近 20 次|20 次提交)|(${ABSENT_MARKER}|最近 20 次|20 次提交).*(没有|未发现|未找到|0)"
